    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Se va mejorar el modelo para la detección de los Rojos"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 175,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Importar librerias \n",
        "from sklearn.model_selection import GridSearchCV\n",
        "from sklearn.metrics import make_scorer\n",
        "from sklearn.metrics import recall_score"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Crear una métrica enfocada en Rojo\n",
        "Así, en lugar de buscar únicamente el modelo con mayor accuracy, vamos a buscar configuraciones que detecten mejor los casos Rojo.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 176,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Métrica personalizada: Recall de la categoría Rojo\n",
        "\n",
        "def recall_rojo(y_true, y_pred):\n",
        "    return recall_score(\n",
        "        y_true,\n",
        "        y_pred,\n",
        "        labels=[\"Rojo\"],\n",
        "        average=\"macro\",\n",
        "        zero_division=0\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "scorer_rojo = make_scorer(recall_rojo)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Definir las combinaciones que se van a probar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 177,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Parámetros que se probarán\n",
        "\n",
        "param_grid = {\n",
        "    \"n_estimators\": [100, 150, 200],\n",
        "    \"learning_rate\": [0.03, 0.05, 0.1],\n",
        "    \"max_depth\": [2, 3, 4],\n",
        "    \"min_samples_split\": [2, 5, 10],\n",
        "    \"min_samples_leaf\": [1, 2, 4]\n",
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Ejecutar GridSearchCV\n",
        "GridSearchCV sirve para buscar automáticamente los mejores hiperparámetros de un modelo en Scikit-Learn.\n",
        "\n",
        "En lugar de que se pruebe manualmente combinaciones, GridSearchCV lo hace por de forma sistemática."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 178,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Fitting 5 folds for each of 243 candidates, totalling 1215 fits\n",
            "Mejores parámetros:\n",
            "{'learning_rate': 0.1, 'max_depth': 4, 'min_samples_leaf': 2, 'min_samples_split': 2, 'n_estimators': 200}\n",
            "\n",
            "Mejor Recall para Rojo:\n",
            "0.8660\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "# Modelo base\n",
        "gb_base = GradientBoostingClassifier(\n",
        "    random_state=42\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# Búsqueda de mejores hiperparámetros\n",
        "grid_search = GridSearchCV(\n",
        "    estimator=gb_base,\n",
        "    param_grid=param_grid,\n",
        "    scoring=scorer_rojo,\n",
        "    cv=5,\n",
        "    n_jobs=-1,\n",
        "    verbose=1\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "grid_search.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Mejores parámetros:\")\n",
        "print(grid_search.best_params_)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nMejor Recall para Rojo:\")\n",
        "print(f\"{grid_search.best_score_:.4f}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Crear el nuevo modelo optimizado"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 179,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Modelo Gradient Boosting optimizado:\n",
            "GradientBoostingClassifier(max_depth=4, min_samples_leaf=2, n_estimators=200,\n",
            "                           random_state=42)\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "# Modelo Gradient Boosting optimizado\n",
        "\n",
        "gradient_boosting_mejorado = grid_search.best_estimator_\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Modelo Gradient Boosting optimizado:\")\n",
        "print(gradient_boosting_mejorado)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Generar nuevas predicciones"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 180,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Predicciones del modelo mejorado\n",
        "\n",
        "y_pred_mejorado = gradient_boosting_mejorado.predict(X_test)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Comparar las métricas"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
